+/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #127270 (listing-card history-btn icon-button — Material mat-mdc-unelevated icon-only primitive parity) — measured live on csfloat /search across 8 cards: every card's bid/auction action row carries button.history-btn with classes "mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base mdc-button--unelevated mat-mdc-unelevated-button mat-unthemed". Computed geometry: width 36px (collapses to 37.1875px when sibling padding pushes the cluster), height 40px, min-width 36px, padding 0 10px, border 0, border-radius 8px, background rgba(193,206,255,0.04) (canonical csfloat icon-button surface tint = exact same alpha/RGB the chips/inputs use), color rgb(255,255,255), display flex, position relative, transition box-shadow 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1) (Material mat-mdc transition primitive). Inner mat-icon.material-icons "history" glyph: 18x18 box, font-size 18px, color rgb(255,255,255). Parent .auction wrapper is display:flex row with gap:10px so the history-btn sits flush to the right of the bid-btn cluster at btnInParent.x = 184.8125px (cluster right-aligned). Tooltip text via mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger + aria-describedby resolves to "Bid History". sbox baseline ships zero history-btn primitive (cards.js GridCard renders only .grid-cart-btn + .grid-star icon-only buttons over the thumb — no inline history/clock-icon button on the action row), so when any future React tree renders <button class="history-btn"> on a grid card the element falls through to default browser button styling — wrong size, wrong bg, wrong border-radius, no Material easing — breaking 1:1 vs csfloat. Ship the canonical primitive as a CSS-only baseline: 36x40 frame + 8px radius + 0 10px padding + canonical 4% white-blue surface tint + ink-light glyph + Material 0.28s cubic-bezier easing on box-shadow + min-width 36px lock + transparent border + cursor default (mat-mdc default for non-clickable triggers). Six measurable refinements bundled below. Pure CSS, APPEND-only, !important to outflank any browser default. Lane: listing-card history-btn icon-button (every csfloat search-result card carries this; sbox parity surface). */
+
+/* 1: 36x40 frame + min-width 36px lock + 0 10px padding + Material 8px radius + 0 border + cursor default — Material mat-mdc-unelevated-button geometry primitive */
+html body .grid-card .history-btn,
+html body .grid-card button.history-btn,
+html body .listing-card .history-btn,
+html body .item-card .history-btn,
+html body .card .history-btn,
+html body button.history-btn {
+  display: flex !important;
+  align-items: center !important;
+  justify-content: center !important;
+  width: 36px !important;
+  min-width: 36px !important;
+  height: 40px !important;
+  min-height: 40px !important;
+  padding: 0 10px !important;
+  margin: 0 !important;
+  border: 0 !important;
+  border-radius: 8px !important;
+  cursor: default !important;
+  position: relative !important;
+  box-sizing: border-box !important;
+  font: 500 14px / 22px "Roboto", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif !important;
+  letter-spacing: 0.0892857em !important;
+  text-transform: none !important;
+  outline: 0 !important;
+  -webkit-appearance: none !important;
+  appearance: none !important;
+}
+
+/* 2: idle background = canonical csfloat 4% white-blue tint rgba(193,206,255,0.04) + white glyph color + transparent outline ring slot */
+html body .grid-card .history-btn,
+html body .grid-card button.history-btn,
+html body .listing-card .history-btn,
+html body .item-card .history-btn,
+html body .card .history-btn,
+html body button.history-btn {
+  background: rgba(193, 206, 255, 0.04) !important;
+  color: rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;
+  box-shadow: none !important;
+  transition: background 200ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
+              color 200ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
+              box-shadow 280ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
+              transform 80ms ease-out !important;
+}
+
+/* 3: hover/focus state — bumped surface tint to ~10% rgba(193,206,255,0.10) per Material state-layer ladder + glyph color shifts to brand rgb(35,123,255) for the canonical csfloat hover affordance, no shadow promotion (icon-only stays flat) */
+html body .grid-card .history-btn:hover,
+html body .grid-card button.history-btn:hover,
+html body .grid-card .history-btn:focus-visible,
+html body .grid-card button.history-btn:focus-visible,
+html body .listing-card .history-btn:hover,
+html body .item-card .history-btn:hover,
+html body .card .history-btn:hover,
+html body button.history-btn:hover,
+html body button.history-btn:focus-visible {
+  background: rgba(193, 206, 255, 0.10) !important;
+  color: rgb(35, 123, 255) !important;
+  cursor: pointer !important;
+}
+
+/* 4: pressed/active feedback — Material mat-mdc-button-ripple compresses with scale(0.94) press + bumped to 16% surface */
+html body .grid-card .history-btn:active,
+html body .grid-card button.history-btn:active,
+html body .listing-card .history-btn:active,
+html body .item-card .history-btn:active,
+html body .card .history-btn:active,
+html body button.history-btn:active {
+  background: rgba(193, 206, 255, 0.16) !important;
+  transform: scale(0.94) !important;
+  transition: transform 80ms ease-out, background 80ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), color 80ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) !important;
+}
+
+/* 5: inner icon glyph — 18x18 mat-icon material-icons box at 18px font-size, white idle / brand on hover, color inherits via currentColor so the parent state cascade flows through to fill+stroke for both ligature and svg variants */
+html body .grid-card .history-btn > mat-icon,
+html body .grid-card .history-btn > .mat-icon,
+html body .grid-card .history-btn > .material-icons,
+html body .grid-card .history-btn > svg,
+html body .grid-card .history-btn > i,
+html body button.history-btn > mat-icon,
+html body button.history-btn > .mat-icon,
+html body button.history-btn > .material-icons,
+html body button.history-btn > svg,
+html body button.history-btn > i {
+  width: 18px !important;
+  height: 18px !important;
+  min-width: 18px !important;
+  min-height: 18px !important;
+  font-size: 18px !important;
+  line-height: 18px !important;
+  color: currentColor !important;
+  fill: currentColor !important;
+  stroke: currentColor !important;
+  flex: 0 0 auto !important;
+  display: inline-flex !important;
+  align-items: center !important;
+  justify-content: center !important;
+  transition: color 200ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), fill 200ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) !important;
+}
+
+/* 6: position on action row — when the history-btn sits inside an .auction or .actions wrapper, mirror csfloat parent layout (flex row, 10px gap, history-btn flush right at end of cluster) so the icon-button anchors to the right edge of the bid/buy cluster like every csfloat card; also disables the browser default focus halo in favor of the focus-visible state-layer above */
+html body .grid-card .auction:has(.history-btn),
+html body .grid-card .actions:has(.history-btn),
+html body .grid-card .card-actions:has(.history-btn),
+html body .grid-card .grid-actions:has(.history-btn) {
+  display: flex !important;
+  flex-direction: row !important;
+  align-items: center !important;
+  gap: 10px !important;
+}
+html body .grid-card .history-btn::-moz-focus-inner {
+  border: 0 !important;
+  padding: 0 !important;
+}
+html body .grid-card .history-btn:focus,
+html body button.history-btn:focus {
+  outline: 0 !important;
+  box-shadow: none !important;
+}
+
+/* END CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #127270 */
+
