+
+/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #127284 (notif drawer mark-all-read — focus-visible ring)
+   measured: csfloat Material text-buttons receive a 2px brand outline with
+   2px offset on keyboard focus (cdk-focused / .cdk-keyboard-focused), letting
